{title: 508 - Anywhere With Jesus}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #508 • }
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: D}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 508}
{meta: category Christian Life - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[D]Anywhere with [G/D]Jesus [D/F#]I can safely go,
[A7]Anywhere He leads me in this [D]world [A7/C#]below;
[D]Anywhere [G/D]without [D/F#]Him, dearest joys [A7]would [D]fade;
[D/A]Anywhere with Jesus I [Bm]am [D/A]not [A7/G]afraid.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Refrain}
[A]Anywhere, [D/A]anywhere! [G/D]Fear I cannot [A]know;
[D/A]Anywhere with Jesus I can [A7/C#]safely [D/F#]go.
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[D]Anywhere [G/D]with [D]Jesus I am not [A7]alone;
[A7]Other friends may fail me, He is [D]still [A7/C#]my [D]own;
[D]Though His hand [G/D]may [D]lead me over drearest ways,
[D/A]Anywhere with Jesus is [Bm]a [D/A]house [A7/G]of [D/F#]praise.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[D]Anywhere [G/D]with [D]Jesus I can go [A7]to [D]sleep,
[A7]When the darkening shadows round about me [D]creep,
[D]Knowing I [G/D]shall [D]waken nevermore [A7]to [D]roam;
[D/A]Anywhere with Jesus will [Bm]be [D/A]home, [A7/G]sweet [D/F#]home.
{end_of_verse}
